# Build context of the production images (apps/api/Dockerfile, apps/web/Dockerfile; Issue #132).
# Nothing secret and nothing built on the host may reach an image layer: environment files,
# Git metadata, dependencies and build output are left out, and the images build from source.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
.git
.github
.claude
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/next-env.d.ts
packages/database/src/generated
# Tests, test output and documentation are not part of an image.
**/__tests__
tests
playwright-report
docs
design-system
deploy
*.md
**/*.log
